# Behmen Studio agent rule

Before exploring or editing this codebase, read and follow **`SITE_CONTEXT.md`** at the repo root.

## Hard constraints

- This is a **static HTML/CSS/vanilla JS** site. No Vue, Nuxt, React, or npm build unless the user explicitly requests a rewrite.
- Prefer small, targeted edits in the files listed in `SITE_CONTEXT.md`.
- Drive work from the **Change requests** checklist in `SITE_CONTEXT.md`; update checkboxes when finishing items.
- Deploy is **push to `main`** (GitHub Pages). Do not invent a deploy pipeline.
- Do **not** treat the in-browser admin / GitHub-token flow as secure production auth.
- Do not add bundling/minifying or new markdown docs unless asked.
- Only commit when the user asks.

## When context is stale

If `SITE_CONTEXT.md` conflicts with the code, trust the code, then update `SITE_CONTEXT.md` so the next agent stays accurate.
